9. Key Takeaways

- ResourceResolver provides access to repository resources.
- ResourceResolverFactory creates ResourceResolver instances.
- Resource represents an individual repository resource.
- ValueMap helps retrieve resource properties.
- Always close the ResourceResolver after use.
- Prefer Service Resource Resolver for backend service operations.

